          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is my pet robot Sevy. It used to do everything I say, but now it's sick, and it might bite people!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I heard Boss Svarog can fix robots, so I'm leaving Sevy here."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Boss Svarog, please please save my Sevy!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When Sevy is all better again, it will come home on its own. It knows the way home!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d30c08c2224d7ad0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*This is a note on a broken robot with no name attached. So, this robot could bite? Unfortunately, it can't anymore.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-91f6ca14db0b2b9f"
          }
        ]
      }
